entry.summary:
PrinceJS just hit 19,200 req/s, beating Hono, Elysia, and .
2.8 kB gzipped\ 576k requests in 30s\ 21% faster than Elysia\ 106% faster than Express import { prince } from "princejs"; const app = prince();
app.get("/", () => ({ hello: "PrinceJS" }));
app.listen(3000);
PrinceJS: 19,200 req/s → 576k\ Hono: 16,212 req/s → 486k\ Elysia: 15,862 req/s → 476k\ Express: 9,325 req/s → 280k
"I didn't beat them. I destroyed the competition." 🔗 Website: https://princejs.vercel.app\ GitHub: https://github.com/MatthewTheCoder1218/princejs
